    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-echo-diver=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"The last thing anyone thinks before they drown stays in the water with them. You can hear it.\"</em></p><p><strong>Tide Recall (1/Soma Break).</strong> Touch a surface, creature, or object. The GM tells you one true thing from its recent past. The lookback window scales with your tier — Tier 1: last 24 hours · Tier 2: last week · Tier 3: last year · Tier 4: anything that ever happened to it. The GM may colour the answer; they may not lie.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"echoDivAbyssalTideRecall\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Tide Recall</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Action (touch)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Touch any surface/creature/object; GM tells you one true thing from its recent past, lookback scales with character tier (24h / week / year / anything).</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
